            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a compressed chewable tablet comprising a population of particles and one or more cannabinoids, the population of particles comprising non-directly compressible (non-DC) sugar alcohol particles, wherein the compressed chewable tablet comprises said non-DC sugar alcohol particles in an amount of at least 10% by weight of the compressed chewable tablet.</p>
